  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity strengthening and research, training, advocacy and communication - IFICO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to contribute to the construction and development of a strategy for advocacy, research, training, advocacy, communication and public opinion in the processes of the National Secretariat of Social Pastoral - Caritas Colombia (SNPS-CC) and the Ecclesiastical Jurisdictions, also improving local leadership in the response to crises in Colombia in favour of the most vulnerable.</narrative>
